WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.801
"It is a perfect spring day!" Jeremy Fisher said.

2
00:00:08.802 --> 00:00:14.300
"Sunshine! Green fly sandwiches!

3
00:00:14.301 --> 00:00:23.996
I'm going to paddle my boat on the pond."

4
00:00:23.997 --> 00:00:28.237
Jeremy climbed into his boat.

5
00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:34.480
He began paddling.

6
00:00:34.481 --> 00:00:38.106
Then he spotted something.

7
00:00:38.107 --> 00:00:43.046
A frog was walking along the pond.

8
00:00:43.047 --> 00:00:46.291
"A new neighbor," Jeremy thought.

9
00:00:46.292 --> 00:00:53.028
"I must meet her!"

10
00:00:53.029 --> 00:01:00.836
Jeremy paddled his boat to the shore.

11
00:01:00.837 --> 00:01:10.711
He tied it to a tall reed.

12
00:01:10.712 --> 00:01:14.781
Then he hopped toward the new frog.

13
00:01:14.782 --> 00:01:18.068
"Hello!" said the frog.

14
00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:21.142
"My name is Ribby Webb.

15
00:01:21.143 --> 00:01:24.613
This pond is my new home."

16
00:01:24.614 --> 00:01:28.610
Jeremy stared at the frog.

17
00:01:28.611 --> 00:01:32.028
She had small brown spots.

18
00:01:32.036 --> 00:01:35.393
She wore a pretty, long dress.

19
00:01:35.394 --> 00:01:39.300
"This frog is beautiful!" he thought.

20
00:01:39.301 --> 00:01:44.762
Jeremy blushed.

21
00:01:44.763 --> 00:01:50.869
"M-m-my name is Jeremy Fisher," he said.

22
00:01:50.870 --> 00:01:53.697
"I live on the pond too."

23
00:01:53.698 --> 00:01:55.887
Ribby smiled at him.

24
00:01:55.888 --> 00:02:03.884
"How nice. You're my neighbor."

25
00:02:03.885 --> 00:02:07.758
Suddenly the tall grass swished.

26
00:02:07.759 --> 00:02:12.639
The two frogs looked over.

27
00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:20.796
"What's that?" Ribby asked.

28
00:02:20.797 --> 00:02:27.317
Jeremy gasped. "It's a water rat!"

